            "value": "无法打开该应用，它可能已移动或发生变化；正在刷新应用列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Application search works without Accessibility. Screen recording is not required for window-title search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Application search works without Accessibility. Screen recording is not required for window-title search."
          }
