    "KeyDock manages up to 8 tasks at once, with 200 task records, 32 AI drafts and 32 MiB of session text. Output stays in memory; after restarting, only task metadata is restored. Finished task and usage records expire after 90 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeyDock manages up to 8 tasks at once, with 200 task records, 32 AI drafts and 32 MiB of session text. Output stays in memory; after restarting, only task metadata is restored. Finished task and usage records expire after 90 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KeyDock 同时管理最多 8 个任务，保留最多 200 条任务记录、32 份 AI 草稿和 32 MiB 会话文本。输出只保存在内存中；重启后仅恢复任务元数据。已结束任务和用量记录的保留期为 90 天。"
          }
        }
      }
