          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This discards finished task output, idle unsaved AI drafts and command suggestions. Running tasks are kept. Terminal commands may still be running; clearing history does not stop them. Saved commands, settings, credentials and clipboard history are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This discards finished task output, idle unsaved AI drafts and command suggestions. Running tasks are kept. Terminal commands may still be running; clearing history does not stop them. Saved commands, settings, credentials and clipboard history are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会丢弃已结束任务的输出、闲置且未保存的 AI 草稿和命令建议。正在运行的任务会保留。终端中的命令可能仍在运行，清除记录不会停止它们。已保存的命令、设置、凭据和剪贴板历史会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This draft is no longer available. Create a new draft to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This draft is no longer available. Create a new draft to continue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此草稿已不可用，请新建草稿后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This executable can act with your user permissions whenever the enabled source is connected. Review its path, arguments and working directory before trusting it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用的来源建立连接后，此可执行文件便可使用当前用户权限执行操作。信任前请检查其路径、参数和工作目录。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This executable can act with your user permissions whenever the enabled source is connected. Review its path, arguments and working directory before trusting it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes stored usage metadata. Running requests keep their current usage and may create new records when they finish. AI actions and API credentials are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes stored usage metadata. Running requests keep their current usage and may create new records when they finish. AI actions and API credentials are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除已保存的用量元数据。正在运行的请求保留本次用量，结束后可能产生新记录。AI 动作和 API 凭据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This saved workflow may launch commands and send its input or output to the displayed AI service without another prompt at each scheduled time. Review every command and destination.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此已保存的工作流可在每个计划时间执行命令，并将输入或输出发送至所显示的 AI 服务，届时不会再次询问。请检查所有命令和发送目标。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This saved workflow may launch commands and send its input or output to the displayed AI service without another prompt at each scheduled time. Review every command and destination."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This shortcut sends only the configured input to your selected API. Replacement is a separate action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This shortcut sends only the configured input to your selected API. Replacement is a separate action."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此快捷键仅将配置的输入发送至所选 API。替换选区需单独操作。"
          }
        }
      }
